Backport of LivingMemory PR #348 (2.7.3):
https://github.com/lxfight-s-Astrbot-Plugins/astrbot_plugin_livingmemory/pull/348
Upstream implementation: 6537d07029584d786e421c0ba1acc9ab76b47e82
Adapted to the pinned 2.6.1 baseline; retain local write-operation journaling.
BEGIN cancellation also queues rollback, and close uses the same write lock.

